  "description": "Meet Roam—a step-through, full-suspension e-bike built for everyday comfort and all-terrain confidence. A 750W (95 Nm) rear-hub motor paired with a torque sensor delivers smooth, proportional power, while the 52V 15.6Ah battery supports up to 62 miles of range. With 26×4.0″ puncture-resistant fat tires, hydraulic disc brakes (180 mm), and a tuned front/rear suspension, Roam keeps rides stable, cushioned, and in control—on city streets or gravel paths. Top speed up to 28 mph.\n\nQuick Highlights\n\nStep-through frame for easy on/off; full-suspension comfort.\n\n750W motor with torque/cadence sensor for intuitive assist.\n\n52V 15.6Ah battery, up to 62 miles per charge.\n\n26×4.0″ fat tires + hydraulic disc brakes (180 mm) for grip & control.\n\nTop speed up to 28 mph; payload 350 lb; recommended height 5'7″–6'7″.\n\nKey Specs\nBattery: 52V 15.6Ah | Charge time 7–9 h | 800 cycles lifetime • Motor: 52V 750W brushless rear hub • Assist: Torque sensor, thumb throttle • Tires: 26″×4.0″ puncture-resistant • Brakes: Fully hydraulic, 180 mm F/R • Display: mid-mounted color LCD (with USB) • Weight (with battery): 81.6 lb • Frame: 6061 aluminum with internal battery.",
